    "note": "YeastPhenome yp-data is a curated re-presentation of primary screens: measured against two primary releases, it negates Parsons 2006's released log2 ratio, averages Yoshikawa 2009's two cultures per condition and pools strains its ORF translation merges into one locus; fields the curation does not carry are typed gaps."
